      "snippet": {
        "line": 851,
        "text": "normalizedPrefixAxial c + normalizedPrefixAngular c ≤ prefixBoundConstant c.P c.m * logarithmicRate c.lam, where normalizedPrefixAxial c = c.lam * prefixAxialEnergy c / normalization c, normalization c = exp c.pulseStart * pulseAmplitude c ^ 2 and logarithmicRate lam = lam * (1 + log (1/lam))"
